"动更新。"

msgid ""
"After you submit, a maintainer reviews the plugin. Follow it on the change "
"page, and GitHub notifies you of the review."
msgstr ""
"提交后由维护者审核，进度可以在变更页面查看，审核结果也会通过 GitHub 通知你。"

msgid "No suggestion reviewed yet"
msgstr "尚未审核过建议"

msgid "Usually reviews within two days"
msgstr "通常在两天内审核"

msgid "Usually reviews within a week"
msgstr "通常在一周内审核"

msgid "Reviews take longer than a week"
msgstr "审核时间通常超过一周"

msgid "%{n} suggestions sent for review."
msgstr "已提交 %{n} 条建议等待审核。"

msgid "Some suggestions could not be sent. Check them for words a name may not hold."
msgstr "部分建议未能提交，请检查其中是否含有名称不允许使用的词。"

msgid "Accepted, waiting for the merge"
msgstr "已接受，等待合并"

